==================================================================================
  Summary
==================================================================================
  Family A avg speedup vs PyTorch eager: 0.01x  (n=12)
  Family B avg speedup vs PyTorch eager: 0.04x  (n=4)
  Family C avg speedup vs PyTorch eager: 0.04x  (n=4)
  Family C avg speedup vs PyTorch SDPA:  0.02x  (n=4)

  Note: MatcoreDSL times include host→device memcpy per call.
  PyTorch times are GPU-only (CUDA events, data pre-staged on GPU).
  A true apples-to-apples comparison needs device-resident tensors
  in MatcoreDSL (planned for next phase).
